{command} <question> | reset | aiset <sub>
Ask the AI anything. Powered by Groq with a friendly, slightly mischievous personality.
*/ <question>   - ask the AI anything (auto-detects your language, replies in the same language)
*/ reset        - clear your conversation history with the AI
*/ aiset        - AI admin settings (see below)

aiset subcommands (access level 1 for basic, 3 for admin):
*/ aiset on|off [global]    - toggle AI on/off (in this room or globally)
*/ aiset model [1-7]        - switch Groq model
*/ aiset ulimit <jid> <n>   - set per-user history limit (or reset, or list)
*/ aiset reset all          - wipe all user history
*/ aiset history <sub>      - save|load|info|clear history & room logs
*/ aiset quota              - show Groq API quota (requests, tokens, reset times)
*/ aiset ping               - test Groq connectivity
*/ aiset reloadkey          - reload Groq API key from file
*/ aiset info               - full AI status (provider, model, users, messages)

Notes:
*/ Language detection: the AI auto-detects the language of your message and replies in the same language.
*/ Room context: when used in a room, the AI also sees recent room messages as context.
*/ Rate limits: each user has a history limit (default 40 messages). Reset with 'ai reset'.
*/ Ollama has been removed -- provider is now fixed to Groq.
